@@ -0,0 +1,867 @@
+"""
+T-00a: the alert scheduler (core/alerts.py) at unit level, on a VIRTUAL clock: no real waits,
+no threads, no espeak. Runs in the Poetry environment and in my_hailo_env alike.
+
